<title>SINGAPORE: GB Holdings half-year net loss deepens.</title>
<headline>GB Holdings half-year net loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.51  vs   0.48</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)  (loss)	  0.70  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Turnover				23.24  vs  25.25</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.44  vs   0.28</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.19  vs   0.12</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     1.44  vs   1.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 0.49  vs   0.50</p>
<p>    Tax					0.04  vs   0.01</p>
<p>Note - GB Holdings Ltd, a manufacturer of diesel-powered cruisers and watercraft, said its first half results were affected by lower sales in its major markets and operating results in the second half are not expected to improve.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
